{
	"name": "Agitating Hairs",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/air/fog-gas-smoke-brown.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As a bonus action you may use your secondary pair of arms to rapidly rub at any exposed area of your body, sending this hairs up into a cloud in a 5-foot radius centered on you. All creatures in the area of effect must succeed on a Constitution saving throw versus your maneuver DC or become [[/condition id=blinded]] until the end of your next turn. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a long rest.</p>",
